Error [E0740]: `touch` uses the effect `DB.Write`, which its signature doesn't allow
  --> tests/ui/db_read_query_hidden_write.jet:8:32
    |
  8 | fn touch(conn: DBConnection) =[DB.Read]=> {
    |                                ^^^^^^^
 Why: the signature declares `=[DB.Read]=>`, so the body may only use those; `DB.Write` is outside that set
 Fix: add `DB.Write` to the effect list, or stop using it in `touch`
